# Chrome Mox: "you may exile a nonartifact, nonland card from your hand". Bot1's hand, once the Mox is cast, is two
# Islands, a Sol Ring and a Mox Jet -- lands and artifacts, none of which qualifies -- so nothing is asked and nothing is
# exiled (a default answer would take the first card offered). The Mox is left with no imprint.

[Bot1 Deck]
Chrome Mox
Island
Sol Ring
Mox Jet
Island
Island
Island
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Chrome Mox.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Exile.Count = 0
Bot1.Hand = Island; Sol Ring; Mox Jet; Island; Island; Island
Bot1.Battlefield = Chrome Mox
